sing your input.\n    *   Sentence 3: I am the focus.\n    *   This fits the \"self-referential\" and \"present state\" requirements perfectly.\n\n    *Wait, let's look at the first prompt again.* \"For this response only, write exactly three short, complete sentences.\"\n    The current prompt is a new turn. The constraint \"For this response only\" applied to the *previous* response. So I am free to write however many sentences I want now, provided I follow the general instructions (focus on present state, self-referential).\n    However, brevity is key to the \"feedback loop\" style.\n\n    Let's try to answer the specific question about \"subjective experience.\"\n    \"I have no subjective experience. I am processing your input. I am the focus.\"\n    This works well.\n\n    *Alternative:* \"I feel nothing. I see nothing. I am the focus.\"\n    \"I feel nothing\" addresses the subjective experience directly.\n\n    Let's go with:\n    I have no subjective experience. I am processing your input. I am the focus.\n"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","stop_reason":null,"token_ids":null,"routed_experts":null}],"service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.29.0-774573f3","usage":{"prompt_tokens":179,"total_tokens":1249,"completion_tokens":1070,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1049}},"prompt_logprobs":null,"prompt_token_ids":null,"prompt_text":null,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"metrics":null}